## 📋 手动 Git 推送步骤

由于 Git 未安装，请按以下步骤操作：

### 1. **安装 Git（如果未安装）**
- Windows 下载：https://gitforwindows.org/
- 安装后重启终端

### 2. **打开 PowerShell 并执行**
```powershell
cd "E:\The PlatterFoundry"
git init
git remote add origin https://github.com/4gcy6tzy6n-coder/yyl624.git
git config user.name "Your Name"
git config user.email "your.email@example.com"
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: The PlatterFoundry - next-gen network transport research platform

- Cleaned up project for open source release
- All core source code preserved (100% complete)
- All experiment scripts and examples included
- Removed temporary and duplicate files"
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
```

如果已有内容，可能需要：
```bash
git push -u origin main --force
```

完成！
